From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:11:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 78/86] Open <details> keyed by the heading they sit under

A <details> with the same summary added in another section above shifted
the occurrence count, so the open state moved to another block. The key is
now the nearest Markdown heading, the summary, and the occurrence within
that section; only a same-summary block added in its own section still
shifts it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

